-- ButtonPayload — a UI button's label + action + optional params. A
-- validation-surface entity (Telegram/Discord inline-keyboard payloads).
--
-- Static rows: none. The pre-flip inline-TS `defineSystemEntity` is GONE.
--
-- FM-retire-E1 Step 6 — LABEL-LESS entity. defineSystemEntity registered
-- a Codeable unconditionally, but the loader lifts entity facets ONLY
-- when a type_def carries a directive in ENTITY_IDENTITY_FACETS — so a
-- bare `@codeName "ButtonPayload"` is required to trip that gate (emitting
-- the Codeable the auto-register loop keys on). The value is redundant
-- with the type_def name, but its PRESENCE is load-bearing. `params:
-- Maybe ({})` needs parens (compound `{}` arg).

@entity
@codeName "ButtonPayload"
ButtonPayload = ButtonPayload label: NonEmptyStr action: NonEmptyStr params: Maybe ({})
